flowchart LR
    A[ERD draft] --> B[CREATE TABLE]
    B --> C[INSERT sample data]
    C --> D[SELECT tables]
    D --> E[JOIN validation]
    E --> F[CRUD SQL]

    F --> G[SELECT before UPDATE]
    G --> H[UPDATE]
    H --> I[SELECT after UPDATE]

    F --> J[SELECT before DELETE]
    J --> K[DELETE or status update]
    K --> L[SELECT after DELETE]

    E --> M{Can answer requirements?}
    M -- No --> A
    M -- Yes --> N[Design validated]
